  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The acceleration due to gravity with depth is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>R</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>The given data is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Let the weight be at the given depth,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>W</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></math>. Hence, the value is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mi>R</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>The Weight&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>W</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>W</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>200</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
